# Hardware Lifecycle System

All hardware ages.

Lifecycle Stages:

## New

- Peak performance
- Lowest failure rate

## Mature

- Stable operation
- Normal maintenance

## Aging

- Increased power draw
- Higher failure risk

## Obsolete

- Poor efficiency
- Frequent maintenance

Player Choices:

- Continue operating
- Refurbish
- Replace
- Sell

