# Long-Term Infrastructure Goal

The player's infrastructure should tell a visual story.

Beginning:

One computer hosting one website.

Middle:

Rows of racks supporting thousands of customers.

Endgame:

Global cloud regions supporting millions of users and the world's largest companies.

The player should be able to zoom out and visually trace the complete history of their company's growth through the infrastructure they built.

